  "project_id": "3d34708ffb0a4b0b",
  "operation_id": "769f6a626629441ebc551d5572c4259d",
  "brief": "Build exactly one workflow. Read printed text only in the left half of each image: crop normalized [0, 0, 0.5, 1], then resize that crop to width 1200 and height 400 before OCR. Use apple-vision OCR. Compare the recognized text exactly to \"ABC-990\" and show the comparison result. Do not record events or send alerts. Use text_accuracy with target 0.9.",
  "briefs": {
    "crop-reading": "Build exactly one workflow. Read printed text only in the left half of each image: crop normalized [0, 0, 0.5, 1], then resize that crop to width 1200 and height 400 before OCR. Use apple-vision OCR. Compare the recognized text exactly to \"ABC-990\" and show the comparison result. Do not record events or send alerts. Use text_accuracy with target 0.9.",
    "parallel-readers": "Build exactly one workflow that reads both printed text AND barcodes from the whole image, using apple-vision for both readers. Show both kinds of recognized values and their regions. Do not crop or resize. Do not record events or send alerts. Use text_accuracy with target 0.9.",
    "mixed": "Build exactly one workflow that counts people using yolox-s-onnx-coco and reads printed text using apple-vision from the whole image. Detect the person class at confidence 0.25 and show the total count together with recognized text. Do not crop or resize. Do not record events or send alerts. Use count_mae with target 1."
  },
